Affiliation
-----------

Encrypted memories use the Cryptomator vault format (version 8), so Cryptomator
can open them too. Not made by or affiliated with Cryptomator or Skymatic.
"Cryptomator" is a name and trademark of its owners, used here only to say
which format this program reads and writes.


